

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Program minneshantering: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Utdata skriv: ['Text Length: '] + txt längd, stop.
Utdata skriv: ['Character at 2:'] + ( txt tecken: 2 ), stop.
Utdata skriv: (( txt hitta: ['S'] ) - 0), stop.

Program städa.

usedMemory1 := (Program minne ? 0).


txt := ['Word Salad'].
Utdata skriv: ['Text Length: '] + txt längd, stop.
Utdata skriv: ['Character at 2:'] + ( txt tecken: 2 ), stop.
Utdata skriv: (( txt hitta: ['S'] ) - 0), stop.

Program städa.
usedMemory2 := (Program minne ? 0).


txt := ['Word Salad'].
Utdata skriv: ['Text Length: '] + txt längd, stop.
Utdata skriv: ['Character at 2:'] + ( txt tecken: 2 ), stop.
Utdata skriv: (( txt hitta: ['S'] ) - 0), stop.

Program städa.
usedMemory3 := (Program minne ? 0).



( usedMemory1 = usedMemory2 och: usedMemory1 = usedMemory3, och: usedMemory2 = usedMemory3 ) sann: {
	Utdata skriv: ['No memory leaks here'].
}, falsk: {
	Utdata skriv: ['Leaking memory...'].
}.
